OL,3,GNEWSARapist who spiked baby's bottle
OL,4,Awith vodka before abuse jailed for 12
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who raped and abused vulnerable
OL,8,Fchildren for two decades and put vodka
OL,9,Finto a baby's bottle before sexually
OL,10,Fassaulting her has been jailed for 12
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FIan Whyte, 62, carried out a campaign
OL,14,Fof abuse against youngsters in
OL,15,FEdinburgh between December 1978 and May
OL,16,F1998.
OL,18,FThe attack on the baby girl took place
OL,19,Fbetween 1982 and 1983 - when Whyte was
OL,20,Fabout 18 years old and the baby was
OL,21,Funder a year old.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
