OL,4,Awith vodka before abuse jailed for 12
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FJudge Thomas Welsh KC told him: "You
OL,8,Ftargeted and abused vulnerable children
OL,9,Fand teenagers. Your conduct was evil,
OL,10,Fcalculating and pernicious."
